<div class="jlfork">
<p><strong>jlTimer</strong> is a personal, modified fork of <a class="click" href="https://github.com/cs0x7f/cstimer" title="">csTimer</a> by Shuang Chen (cs0x7f), distributed under the GNU GPLv3. It keeps csTimer's timing, scrambles, statistics, virtual cube and data format, and adds a jlTimer theme, a minimal layout and virtual-cube sizing.</p>
<p>jlTimer is not affiliated with or operated by csTimer. Server backup, WCA/Google login, online competitions and battle rooms are csTimer's services at cstimer.net; they may not work from this domain. Your solves are stored in this browser. Use <strong>Export to file</strong> regularly.</p>
</div>
